# Project Aur Bhai — hard exclusions (secrets, generated, non-editable artifacts)

# --- Secrets & BYOK credentials (never in AI context) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
key.properties
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/secrets.json
**/credentials.json

# --- Flutter build & tool cache (explicit; many overlap .gitignore) ---
.dart_tool/
build/
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/.symlinks/
**/.gradle/
**/Pods/
.cxx/

# --- Auto-generated by `flutter pub get` (zero edit value) ---
**/generated_plugin_registrant.*
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# --- Flutter tooling metadata ---
.metadata

# --- Future milestone artifacts (manifest: ONNX vault, local DB exports) ---
**/*.onnx
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite

# --- Xcode project trees (large, auto-managed; rarely hand-edited in Flutter) ---
ios/Runner.xcodeproj/
ios/Runner.xcworkspace/
macos/Runner.xcodeproj/
macos/Runner.xcworkspace/
